status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m001-0432","start":432,"end":434,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002095","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m001-0444","start":444,"end":445,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或指代待核；不補姓名、成員或親屬關係。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p028","text":"七年，鄭與晉盟鄢陵。八年，楚莊王以鄭與晉盟，來伐，圍鄭三月，鄭以城降楚。楚王入自皇門，鄭襄公肉袒掔羊以迎，曰：「孤不能事邊邑，使君王懷怒以及獘邑，孤之罪也。敢不惟命是聽。君王遷之江南，及以賜諸侯，亦惟命是聽。若君王不忘厲、宣王，桓、武公，哀不忍絶其社稷，錫不毛之地，使復得改事君王，孤之願也，然非所敢望也。敢布腹心，惟命是聽。」莊王爲卻三十里而後舍。楚群臣曰：「自郢至此，士大夫亦久勞矣。今得國捨之，何如？」莊王曰：「所爲伐，伐不服也。今已服，尚何求乎？」卒去。晉聞楚之伐鄭，發兵救鄭。其來持兩端，故遲，比至河，楚兵已去。晉將率或欲渡，或欲還，卒渡河。莊王聞，還撃晉。鄭反助楚，大破晉軍於河上。十年，晉來伐鄭，以其反晉而親楚也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"鄭襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002170","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"厲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002096","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0111","start":111,